	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tametsi nos egregie consolatur dominus, libenter tamen et magno cum gaudio, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>dum a piis consolamur<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> bezieht sich auf <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief vom 25. Oktober (oben <ref target="file11364">Nr. 1321</ref>).</note>, accipimus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quamobrem velim istudipsum esse quam frequentissimum; <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>adeo non est, ut alter alterum hic possit uno verbo erigere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Iacet ecclesia; id quod dum conquestus sum<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Siehe oben <ref target="file11356">Nr. 1313</ref>.</note>, poenitus est<pb type="edition" next="244"/> subversa<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Die Verschärfung der Spannungen ist ablesbar am Ratsdekret vom 7. Oktober, mit dem die Pfarrer an ihre Unterstellung unter die neue Universitätsordnung erinnert und in verschiedenen Punkten ermahnt wurden (gedruckt in: Peter <hi>Ochs,</hi> Geschichte der Stadt und Landschaft Basel, Bd. VI, Basel 1821, S. 145-147; vgl. <hi>Burckhardt-</hi> Biedermann 476).</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Verbum ad<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>huc habet sic quidem liberum, ut verear, ne et hoc propediem tollatur; scopus e<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nim totius tentationis fuit in animis malorum libertatem e suggestu praecipitem dare.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Ad quam rem usi sunt isthoc viro<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p4349">Karlstadt</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">De quo ne quid pluribus dicam, ex his est, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ad quos sermo pertinet prophetę: „Dicite placentia.“<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><cit type="bible"><ref>Jes 30,</ref></cit> ID.</note></s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Hic tam est diligens, ut credere <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nequeam alium scopum esse praefixum<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>nach</hi> praefixum <hi>gestrichenes</hi> ei[?].</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Hodie venit ad me bonus vir<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Unbekannt.</note> eiusmodi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>verbis: „Cavendum est, ne vir iste lędatur; nam hac est authoritate apud suos, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ut, si hominem occidisset, ablaturus esset impune.“</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Age, hanc amentiam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>equidem puto per patientiam superandam.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Propediem alia cantio (vel domino suggerent<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>e) cantabitur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Post tam longam concertationem illud consequutum, ut ministerium <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vilipendatur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Nescio, an id quęsitum; imo scio nihil aliud quęsitum esse.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Habent, quod quęsierunt, et tamen currunt ad conciones meas praeter paucos, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quos nolim numerari certe inter meos.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quid velint, plane me fugit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Audiunt veterem <persName ref="p8418">Myconium</persName> et in corripiendis vitiis etiam diligentiorem quam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>antea.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Pati malum quam ferre hominum iniquitatem, quantum in me est, malo.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Satis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>est, quod ipse pecco, non valeo portare peccata aliena; sic iubet officium, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et pugnant cum praeceptis dei dehonestantque nomen eius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Quid ille?</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Lapsis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>diebus concionatus est, ut divisa sit terra Iudęis ab Iosue<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Jos 13-21</ref></cit>.</note>; hic con<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sumpsit duos dies cum hac exaggeratione.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Hęc scire christianum oporteret, ea <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>autem postquam geographia et cosmographia docerent, etiam his artibus opus esse <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>christiano.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Sic consolatur in domino conscientias hac misera tempestate.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Dominus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>det illi cor bonum et mentem sanam, quod ex animo precor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Quę scribis de <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName ref="p19042">Barbarossa</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Oben <ref target="file11364">Nr. 1321</ref>, 17-21.</note>, mirum quam gratum feceris; adeo nihil novarum rerum hic <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>est.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Credo famam pessimam de nobis a scribendo pios et amicos viros <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>deterrere<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>nach</hi> deterrere <hi>gestrichenes a</hi> scribendo.</note>.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Quęso, ne tu quoque absterrearis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">De dissensione <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>in ędibus nostris audieram; qui narrabat, ex concionatoribus vestris est, si recte <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>novi; nomen nescio.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Aiebat <persName ref="p8412">Gasparem</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p8412">Kaspar Megander</persName>; vgl. ebd., Z. 26-29.</note> abolere velle multa, quę instituisse<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>t<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>korrigiert aus</hi> instuisset.</note> <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglius</persName>, te reniti et<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">et <hi>über gestrichenem</hi> te.</note> pauciores habere fautores quam alterum, et nescio <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quę alia.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Gaudeo mentitum esse nebulonem, quisquis est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p4830">Phrygioni</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p4830">Adam Frey</persName>; vgl. oben Nr. ebd., Z. 30f.</note> equidem <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>bene volo; dominus adsit causę eius, si egerit in ipso.<pb type="edition" next="245"/></s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Uxor<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p5896">Margret</persName>.</note> mea decumbit <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>gravissime; dominum orabis pro utroque.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis in Christo domino.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Salutabis <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> et <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, raptim, 29. octobris <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>anno 39.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myconius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>tuus ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bul<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>lingero</persName>, antistiti <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, in domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>perquam colendo suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
